s directory structure and documentation to clearly\ndefine this as the BASE repository for shared agent skills, with git\nsubtree as the sync mechanism for consumer repositories.\n\nChanges:\n- Clarify this is the base repo throughout all documentation\n- Add comprehensive .agents/README.md with subtree setup instructions\n- Update DEVELOPMENT.md with base vs consumer repo rules\n- Add AGENTS.md with repo-wide rules and Definition of Done\n- Update README.md to explain subtree workflow and contribution process\n- Remove outdated vendoring and git submodule instructions\n- Define local override precedence for consumer repos\n- Establish promotion workflow: consumer local → base PR → subtree pull\n- Add format check to Definition of Done\n- Update all skill path references for consistency\n\nStructure enforces:\n- Base repo (.agents/skills/) = source of truth, edit directly\n- Consumer repos (.agents/agents-playbooks/) = synced via subtree, read-only\n- Consumer overrides (.agents/local/) = take precedence over base\n- Explicit promotion path with review process","tree":{"sha":"11683cea6cb4887bf0db08eaab6d97d65c7d56a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrebenkendorf/agents-playbooks/git/trees/11683cea6cb4887bf0db08eaab6d97d65c7d56a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrebenkendorf/agents-playbooks/git/commits/d8e13d356adb612fe1706c2c1fb5d82c0afb4766","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11325962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrebenkendorf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrebenkendorf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrebenkendorf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrebenkendorf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrebenkendorf","id":11325962,"login":"alexan