"user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/7199bf815dc541f57f71ce5a0fd85acd5808c245","node_id":"C_kwDORI53edoAKDcxOTliZjgxNWRjNTQxZjU3ZjcxY2U1YTBmZDg1YWNkNTgwOGMyNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5","sha":"019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5"}],"sha":"7199bf815dc541f57f71ce5a0fd85acd5808c245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/7199bf815dc541f57f71ce5a0fd85acd5808c245"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T10:38:42Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T10:38:42Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"feat(settings): add file-specific encoding overrides\n\nIntroduces the ability to set encoding overrides for individual files within a repository. This complements the existing repository-wide default encoding setting.\n\n- Added `cmd_set_file_encoding_override` Tauri command and its implementation in `settings_commands.rs`.\n- Modified `CommitGraph.svelte`, `CommitPanel.svelte`, `FileHistoryPanel.svelte`, and `ConflictResolveModal.svelte` to:\n    - Fetch and display file-specific encoding settings.\n    - Allow users to select and save file-specific encoding overrides.\n    - Handle the \"default\" encoding option to clear overrides.\n- Updated `GitService.ts` to expose the new `setFileEncodingOverride` method.\n- Modified `EncodingSelector.svelte` to include a \"Repository Default\" option and handle its selection.\n- Updated `RepositoryService.ts` to include the `setFileEncodingOverride` method.","tree":{"sha":"1a6193969c18b28615da7875025ba0d8b65c9ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/trees/1a6193969c18b28615da7875025ba0d8b65c9ae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/commits/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5","node_id":"C_kwDORI53edoAKDAxOWM4YTQ1ZWMxYWY5MGI5NWQ1YTc4ODBkZjZkNzlkOTMxYWQyZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed","sha":"07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed"}],"sha":"019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/019c8a45ec1af90b95d5a7880df6d79d931ad2d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T06:26:23Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T06:26:23Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"feat(settings): add repository-specific default encoding\n\nIntroduces the ability to configure a default file encoding on a per-repository basis. This allows users to override the global default encoding for specific repositories that may use non-standard encodings.\n\n- Added `cmd_set_repo_default_encoding` Tauri command and its implementation in `settings_commands.rs`.\n- Modified `git::encoding::resolve_file_encoding` to accept and check for repository-specific encodings.\n- Updated `git::encoding::decode_bytes` and `git::encoding::encode_string` to pass the repository path to `resolve_file_encoding`.\n- Added `repo_default_encodings` field to `AppSettings` in `settings.rs`.\n- Integrated the new setting into the `SettingsView.svelte` component, allowing users to select and apply a default encoding for the current repository.\n- Updated `GitService.ts` to include `repo_default_encodings` in the `AppSettings` interface.\n- Added new CSS classes (`ws-space`, `ws-tab`) for improved whitespace rendering in diff views.\n- Modified `diff-utils.ts` to use the new whitespace rendering classes.\n- Updated `RepositoryService.ts` to expose the new `setRepoDefaultEncoding` method.","tree":{"sha":"fd0d360f2a156afbd4d82b971ffd64cdf5478d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/trees/fd0d360f2a156afbd4d82b971ffd64cdf5478d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/commits/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed","node_id":"C_kwDORI53edoAKDA3YjkzNTM1ZDU3NzVkZTlmNGNiZjg1NGI4NjFkY2YyOWU2Nzg2ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commit/b5408f56bb16dace599329d277565461c0062d9d","sha":"b5408f56bb16dace599329d277565461c0062d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/b5408f56bb16dace599329d277565461c0062d9d"}],"sha":"07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/07b93535d5775de9f4cbf854b861dcf29e6786ed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/b5408f56bb16dace599329d277565461c0062d9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:13:31Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:13:31Z","email":"hieu.nt@vinx.com.vn","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"Fix","tree":{"sha":"5c8733d414e71354dba4ff9abce5be386414a48f","u