om/users/TrungHieu0107/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/3ae772eb94779e2783fcaba289d943e4ba32d689/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T13:28:24Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T13:28:24Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"Refactor git parsing and commit-graph UI\n\nRestructures and modularizes backend parsing for git status, diffs, and commit-changed-files to improve readability and testability and to ensure consistent normalization/filtering of results.\n\nRefactors the commit graph UI logic: pulls config into a single destructured object, centralizes commit selection/loading, introduces requestAnimationFrame-based column resizing for smoother performance, and replaces ad-hoc handlers with reusable, promise-aware action utilities and consolidated context-action dispatchers.\n\nAdds small UX and type improvements: new diff viewer props type, minor CSS utility classes, and helper functions to build trees and parse ref badges. Overall these changes make behavior more predictable, easier to maintain, and more performant.","tree":{"sha":"0e32ed56ad64c7da3e896359b614f0504ac76519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/trees/0e32ed56ad64c7da3e896359b614f0504ac76519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/commits/3ae772eb94779e2783fcaba289d943e4ba32d689","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87074742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/following{/o