repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/d4f456eea231f5943a017e7b3d38b0ed5926dff5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T13:00:00Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T13:00:00Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"Adds enhanced file context menu and blame UI polish\n\nAdds richer file context menu actions and improves blame view styling.\n\nProvides actions to show file history and blame, open files in external diff tool, editor, or default program, show file in folder, copy path, edit, and delete files. Introduces path normalization and dynamic menu sizing to handle grouped actions and separators. Wraps external operations in try/catch (relying on service-level toasts) and prompts for confirmation before destructive deletes.\n\nAlso refines blame view layout by adding a bordered content column and a styled, hover-aware content block for better readability. Adjusts context menu width constant to accommodate new items.\n\nThese changes improve discoverability and usability of file operations from the commit graph and make blame output visually clearer.","tree":{"sha":"ede16d6d311b7684c37f21bbb88dd9d7e13cb673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/trees/ede16d6d311b7684c37f21bbb88dd9d7e13cb673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/git/commits/d4f456eea231f5943a017e7b3d38b0ed5926dff5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser