/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TrungHieu0107","id":87074742,"login":"TrungHieu0107","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDc0NzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrungHieu0107","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrungHieu0107/git-tools/commits/8bdd8065d584b826074a637374c7fa178daa3097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T06:23:02Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T06:23:02Z","email":"ntrunghieu1701@gmail.com","name":"trunghieu0107"},"message":"Improve commit graph rendering and interactivity\n\nReplace the previous graph layout and rendering approach with a more robust layout and path builder to produce straighter, gap-aware edge routes and stable lane coloring. Memoize edge geometry to avoid unnecessary recomputation and add visual/UX improvements: larger row/column sizing, refined node radii and padding, edge fade-in animation, row highlighting, selection styling, and a bounded tooltip that follows hover with keyboard accessibility and ARIA labeling.\n\nAlso wire up richer mouse/keyboard handlers for hover, focus, tooltip positioning, and Enter/Space activation to make the graph more discoverable and navigable.\n\nApply package-lock metadata tweaks.\n\nThese changes improve performance, accessibility, and visual clarity of the commit graph while keeping lane assignments stable across renders.","tree":{"sha":"5f57bcc38e93f41fa30d7d33064d