url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/9e033022cc74ffb8f8cc2e0bcfdb1c8bb9adb8ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T04:35:24Z","email":"koushaku.tei@shineos.com","name":"GuangxiZheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T04:35:24Z","email":"koushaku.tei@shineos.com","name":"GuangxiZheng"},"message":"feat: インタラクティブTUI実装とバグ修正\n\n- インタラクティブTUIシステムを追加\n  * tui-core.sh: 色設定、端末制御、ユーティリティ関数\n  * tui-keyboard.sh: vim風キーバインド、キー入力ハンドリング\n  * tui-renderer.sh: 画面描画エンジン、タスクボード描画\n  * tui-dialogs.sh: モーダルダイアログ（確認、入力、タスク詳細、ヘルプ）\n  * tui-interactive.sh: メインインタラクティブTUIアプリケーション\n  * `orch interactive` / `orch i`: インタラクティブTUIを起動\n\n- TUIバグ修正\n  * failedタスクがBoard/Dashboard TUIのRejectedカラムに表示されない問題を修正\n  * tui-renderer.sh: 構文エラー（クォート、括弧）を修正\n  * tui-dialogs.sh: パスワードマスキング、jqフィルターの構文を修正\n\n- orchestrator.sh改善\n  * 配列処理をmapfileを使用するよう変更（word splitting回避）\n  * printfを使用してJSONエスケープの改行問題を修正\n\n- README.md更新\n  * TUIダッシュボードとボードのドキュメント追加\n  * ログ監視コマンドの詳細追加\n\n- テスト改善\n  * bats_helper.bash: assert_outputに--partialフラグ追加\n  * テスト環境でのプロセス待機を削除（ハング回避）\n  * セットアップ/ティアダウンでバックアップと復元を追加","tree":{"sha":"45a95d16352ddccdc389b4ca955d13f6943fe1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/git/trees/45a95d16352ddccdc389b4ca955d13f6943fe1bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/git/commits/9e033022cc74ffb8f8cc2e0bcfdb1c8bb9adb8ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97036592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GuangxiZheng","id":97036592,"login":"GuangxiZheng","node_id":"U_kgDOBcipMA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commit/9e033022cc74ffb8f8cc2e0bcfdb1c8bb9adb8ff","node_id":"C_kwDORJA7C9oAKDllMDMzMDIyY2M3NGZmYjhmOGNjMmUwYmNmZGIxYzhiYjlhZGI4ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commit/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9","sha":"bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9"}],"sha":"9e033022cc74ffb8f8cc2e0bcfdb1c8bb9adb8ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/9e033022cc74ffb8f8cc2e0bcfdb1c8bb9adb8ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97036592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GuangxiZheng","id":97036592,"login":"GuangxiZheng","node_id":"U_kgDOBcipMA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-09T13:18:28Z","email":"koushaku.tei@shineos.com","name":"GuangxiZheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-09T13:18:28Z","email":"koushaku.tei@shineos.com","name":"GuangxiZheng"},"message":"feat: AIフルスタック開発チーム向け6フェーズ機能拡張を実装\n\nPhase 1: Architectエージェントとタスクスキーマ拡張\n- 新規Architectエージェント（API設計、スキーマ設計、インターフェース契約）\n- タスクスキーマ拡張（contracts, deliverables, verification_steps, definition_of_done）\n- 契約タイプテンプレート（OpenAPI, TypeScript, Prisma）\n\nPhase 2: Reviewerエージェントとレビューワークフロー\n- 新規Reviewerエージェント（コードレビュー、品質保証）\n- 新規ステータス: review_needed, rejected\n- 自動プリレビューチェック（pre-review-check.sh）\n- レビューコマンド: review, approve, reject, review-create\n\nPhase 3: コンテキスト・メモリ機能\n- ADR（Architecture Decision Record）システム\n- context-manager.shによるプロジェクト記憶管理\n- コンテキストファイル（current_state, coding_conventions, project_glossary）\n- agent.shへのコンテキスト読み込み統合\n\nPhase 4: 安全な並列実行機能\n- ファイルベースPIDロック機構（task-lock.sh）\n- Git Worktree対応（merge-worktree.sh）\n- 依存関係可視化と循環依存検出\n- Worktree起動オプション（USE_WORKTREE）\n\nPhase 5: ドキュメントテンプレート機能\n- テンプレートシステム実装（template-manager.sh）\n- テンプレート: feature-spec, table-design, api-flow, architecture-diagram\n- 関連ドキュメント同期（sync-related-docs.sh）\n- docs.jsonエージェントの拡張\n\nPhase 6: CLI TUIダッシュボード\n- tui-dashboard.sh: メインダッシュボード（統計、エージェント状態、ログ）\n- tui-taskboard.sh: カンバン形式タスクボード\n- tui-logs.sh: ライブログビューア（色分け、フィルタリング、フォローモード）\n- orchestrator.shにTUIコマンド統合（dashboard, board, logs-tui）\n\nコマンド追加:\n- orch deps: 依存関係表示\n- orch merge: Worktreeマージ\n- orch lock-status: ロック状態表示\n- orch dashboard/--watch/--loop: TUIダッシュボード\n- orch board/--watch/--loop: TUIタスクボード\n- orch logs-tui: TUIログビューア\n- orch context: コンテキスト管理\n- orch template: テンプレート管理","tree":{"sha":"cac25bfad5e0d2c70c9127fd7ef8616cf3db29e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/git/trees/cac25bfad5e0d2c70c9127fd7ef8616cf3db29e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/git/commits/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97036592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GuangxiZheng","id":97036592,"login":"GuangxiZheng","node_id":"U_kgDOBcipMA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuangxiZheng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commit/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9","node_id":"C_kwDORJA7C9oAKGJkYTM5MzgwODdkYjgwZmVmMDdjZDU0NGRhOTg5YjA0ZjI4ODFhYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commit/5a7348d1bd2bad7bd630d0e0d5a5ac9acb15fda6","sha":"5a7348d1bd2bad7bd630d0e0d5a5ac9acb15fda6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/5a7348d1bd2bad7bd630d0e0d5a5ac9acb15fda6"}],"sha":"bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shineos/claude-orchestra/commits/bda3938087db80fef07cd544da989b04f2881aa9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97036592?v=4","e