3223,"login":"himavarshithreddy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzUzMjIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/commits/27279bed47c555e878e01ec1e66b054238ce9f5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T10:20:43Z","email":"himavarshithreddy@gmail.com","name":"Himavarshith Reddy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T10:20:43Z","email":"himavarshithreddy@gmail.com","name":"Himavarshith Reddy"},"message":"feat: Initialize project and setup core configurations\n\nThis commit sets up the foundational structure for the Multipanel Interview AI application. It includes:\n\n-   **Project setup:** Initializes a new Vite project with React and TypeScript.\n-   **Dependencies:** Adds necessary dependencies for React, Recharts, and the Google Generative AI SDK.\n-   **Configuration:** Configures Vite for development and builds, sets up TypeScript compiler options, and defines environment variables for API keys.\n-   **Asset management:** Includes a basic `.gitignore` and updates the README with local run instructions.\n-   **Type definitions:** Adds core TypeScript types for application stages, candidate profiles, panelists, evaluation metrics, and reporting.\n-   **Utility functions:** Implements basic audio processing utilities for handling PCM data.\n-   **Service scaffolding:** Creates a placeholder for the Gemini service, ready for API integration.\n-   **HTML structure:** Sets up the main `index.html` with basic styling and script imports.","tree":{"sha":"845e5a9048f63624775742f996c3abc78e9fd4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/git/trees/845e5a9048f63624775742f996c3abc78e9fd4e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/git/commits/27279bed47c555e878e01ec1e66b054238ce9f5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65753223?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/himavarshithreddy","id":65753223,"login":"himavarshithreddy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzUzMjIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/himavarshithreddy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/commit/27279bed47c555e878e01ec1e66b054238ce9f5b","node_id":"C_kwDORJLb-NoAKDI3Mjc5YmVkNDdjNTU1ZTg3OGUwMWVjMWU2NmIwNTQyMzhjZTlmNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/commit/3d06e512c18de1995d9e6f45f2bd3095552af62d","sha":"3d06e512c18de1995d9e6f45f2bd3095552af62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/himavarshithreddy/InterviewOS/commits/3d06e512c18de1995d9e6f45f2bd3095552af62d"}],"sha":"27279bed47c555e878e01ec1e66b054238ce