1132fedd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/commits/01c7e89d010e6694152f560f0049ad731132fedd"}],"sha":"7a8a187304ed8d6472d99c9b804649ca01e94a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/commits/7a8a187304ed8d6472d99c9b804649ca01e94a4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12767822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bedouijesser","id":12767822,"login":"bedouijesser","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzY3ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/commits/01c7e89d010e6694152f560f0049ad731132fedd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:53:31Z","email":"bedouijesser@gmail.com","name":"Jesser Bedoui"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:55:38Z","email":"bedouijesser@gmail.com","name":"Jesser Bedoui"},"message":"feat: e2e tests, SEO overhaul, i18n infrastructure, UI polish, a11y fixes\n\nE2E testing:\n- Playwright setup with 20 tests across auth, admin, blog, contact, public pages\n- Route interception for contact form (tests success/error independently of SMTP)\n- Honest assertions — no false positives, conditional skips for dynamic Sanity data\n\nSEO:\n- robots.txt + dynamic sitemap (Sanity blog posts included)\n- Canonical URLs on every page via alternates.canonical\n- LocalBusiness JSON-LD structured data (MedicalBusiness, Podiatry)\n- Title tag optimized with location keywords (50-60 char target)\n- Dynamic OG images via next/og (3 routes: homepage, blog listing, blog/[slug])\n- Sanity SEO schema (seo object with ogImage, noIndex, seoTitle, seoDescription)\n\ni18n:\n- Custom cookie-based i18n system (no next-intl — incompatible with Next.js 16)\n- Complete French + English translation files for all sections\n- I18nProvider + useT() hook + middleware for Accept-Language detection\n- LocaleSwitcher component in header nav + mobile menu\n- Header fully migrated to useT() — nav items, CTAs, aria-labels\n\nUI/UX:\n- Color contrast fix: softtail-400 → softtail-600 (2.01:1 → 5.6:1 WCAG AA)\n- #40826D → brand color throughout (was duplicate green not in palette)\n- Removed magenta pink shadow from valuesSection\n- teal-600/700 → softtail-600/700 in ortheses page\n- stone-50 → mainbg in plansSection\n- Redesigned valuesSection (3-column cards, no fragile mt hack)\n- Consistent card design: rounded-2xl, shadow-sm → hover:shadow-xl, y:-4 lift\n- Social links: replaced <Link><Button isIconOnly> with <motion.a> + aria-label\n- Logo links: added aria-label\n- Heading hierarchy: h4 → h3 (was skipping from h1)\n- Nested <a> hydration error fixed in contactSection + plansSection\n- Updated heroSection services cards, SectionRenderer, servicesSection cards\n\nPort: 3099 (avoid conflict with other projects on 3000)","tree":{"sha":"af60036acf08a298484cf430d69310b9e8e19f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/trees/af60036acf08a298484cf430d69310b9e8e19f59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/commits/01c7e89d010e6694152f560f0049ad731132fedd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12767822?v=4","ev