lter tabs\n  with live counts, archive/delete actions\n\n- Cleanup: 9 obsolete pages (orders, product-catalog, product-catalogs,\n  products, dynamic-fields, field-templates, categories) replaced with\n  redirects to /admin/ortheses\n\n- API: /api/appointments and /api/orders now support ?patientId= filter\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7ba7001f62efb997efb7097c47c06df93dc319a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/trees/a7ba7001f62efb997efb7097c47c06df93dc319a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/commits/af481cd9f93cfa0a14f5de1f53521250231af6d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12767822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bedouijesser","id":12767822,"login":"bedouijesser","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzY3ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Podomus/Podomus/commit/af481cd9f93cfa0a14f5de1f53521250231af6d8","node_id":"C_kwDORJSJftoAKGFmNDgxY2Q5ZjkzY2ZhMGExNGY1ZGUxZjUzNTIxMjUwMjMxYWY2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Podomus/Podomus/commit/647190d