/Reethi Rah → BG Studio Dubai/Royal Mirage → Podomus)\n- Fixed bio card stats: 9+ ans, 2 Resorts 5★ BG Studios, 3 pays\n- Standardised phone to +216 51 617 044 across all pages/components\n- Fixed Saturday hours 14h → 13h in a_propos\n- Replaced Portuguese FAQ placeholder with real podiatry content\n- Softened medical overclaims in service page copy\n- Fixed Google Maps embed & link to correct Podomus pin (V6FW+VC Ariana)\n- Fixed JSX syntax error in footer.tsx (<p</p> artifact)\n- Normalised address to \"Imm. Golf Center 2, Bureau BM2, La Soukra 2036\"\n- Added Sanity project env vars (nhjueu5c/production)\n- Fixed AppointmentModal SSR crash (document is not defined) with mounted guard\n- Redesigned AppointmentModal: full-height (96vh) white panel, header strip,\n  backdrop blur, iframe fills flex height — no more cramped scrolling\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5341e28ea541b4469631b8f8928fdb7635c3abb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/trees/5341e28ea541b4469631b8f8928fdb7635c3abb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Podomus/Podomus/git/commits/647190db1786f3aa977c8feb7d973e8c9cbc27f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12767822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bedouijesser","id":12767822,"login":"bedouijesser","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzY3ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bedouijesser/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bed