es%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/computerwwwizards/dinomlx/commits/0138480e6ff95a22bf4db902aea69b5a1aea63e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T04:59:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T04:59:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Refactor dinomlx CLI with DI, Cheerio, and File System Caching\n\n- Implemented CLI entry point using `commander` with `build` command.\n- Set up dependency injection using `@computerwwwizards/dependency-injection`.\n- Implemented core services:\n    - `CheerioTemplateCompiler`: Parses HTML with `xmlMode: true`, generates hash, extracts candidates, and saves metadata JSON to cache (fire-and-forget).\n    - `FileSystemCSSRegister`: Persists CSS registry to `css-registry.json` in cache directory.\n    - `DinomlxBuilder`: Orchestrates the build process, loads existing registry, and saves registry at the end.\n    - `NodeCryptoHashCreator`: Generates SHA256 hashes for components.\n- Added `load()` method to `CSSRegister` interface.\n- Updated `package.json` dependencies.\n- Added verification tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Shadowrunner11 <77254647+Shadowrunner11@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a800b7fdcdfefe6b19699821ca8858c317442b44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/computerwwwizards/dinomlx/git/trees/a800b7fdcdfefe6b19699821ca8858c317442b44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/computerwwwizards/dinomlx/git/