https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/77116d85f5bce4ce559b90652eb5c43bce5db8ab","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDc3MTE2ZDg1ZjViY2U0Y2U1NTliOTA2NTJlYjVjNDNiY2U1ZGI4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c","sha":"53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c"}],"sha":"77116d85f5bce4ce559b90652eb5c43bce5db8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/77116d85f5bce4ce559b90652eb5c43bce5db8ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:48:16Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:48:16Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"fix(datepicker): el panel contra su containing block real, y la hoja a su ancho\n\n**Desktop.** `positionPanel()` calcula coordenadas de viewport, pero\n`position: fixed` solo se resuelve contra el viewport si ningún ancestro\ncrea un containing block. Con `app-modal` coincidía de casualidad —su\nbackdrop es `fixed; inset: 0`, o sea exactamente el viewport— y eso tapó\nel problema hasta el drawer de publicación: `.drawer-panel` queda con un\n`transform` identidad de su animación de entrada, así que es el\ncontaining block. Medido: campo en x=1204, el componente pedía left=1186\ny el panel caía en 1806, terminando en 2112 con un viewport de 1500.\n\n`origenFijo()` busca el ancestro que crea el containing block y convierte.\nLa lista de propiedades va entera —transform, perspective, filter,\nbackdrop-filter, will-change, contain, container-type— antes que ir\nagregando casos a medida que aparecen. La referencia es el padding box,\nde ahí el borde sumado.\n\n**Mobile.** La hoja abarca todo el ancho, pero el calendario tiene 280px\nfijos y quedaba pegado a la izquierda con el resto vacío. Dentro de la\nhoja manda la hoja, con techo de 420px para que en tablet los días no\nqueden separados por media pantalla. `box-sizing: border-box` explícito:\nsin eso el padding se sumaba al 100% y se pasaba 32px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"ed91ee901df9cf7f11ea63287067a2bfc7483918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/ed91ee901df9cf7f11ea63287067a2bfc7483918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDUzYTQ0OGM4ZTAyNjJiMmZkN2NjMDUyZDRkMzVjZDc0ODZkNGEyNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/4e4a7b0dd8c473d9564ad19902517979af83c91d","sha":"4e4a7b0dd8c473d9564ad19902517979af83c91d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/4e4a7b0dd8c473d9564ad19902517979af83c91d"}],"sha":"53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/53a448c8e0262b2fd7cc052d4d35cd7486d4a24c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/4e4a7b0dd8c473d9564ad19902517979af83c91d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:14:13Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T01:14:13Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"fix(shared-utils): un campo con dos controles no puede ser un <label>\n\n`<label>` reenvía el click de todo su interior a su primer control\nenfocable. app-label envuelve el slot completo, así que en un campo con\ndos controles el segundo deja de ser clickeable: en el drawer de\npublicación, tocar la ficha de \"30 días\" abría el calendario del\ndatepicker vecino en vez de aplicar el plazo.\n\n`grupo` —en app-label y pasado por app-form-field— deja el contenedor\ncomo `<div role=\"group\">` con el texto en un `<span>`, sin asociación\nimplícita. El modo por defecto no cambia: un campo con un solo control\nsigue siendo un `<label>`, que es lo correcto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"b8611bd1f4752dd376f029e8beae0d86c90c4028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/b8611bd1f4752dd376f029e8beae0d86c90c4028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/4e4a7b0dd8c473d9564ad19902517979af83c91d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https