91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/07a935303b6f72bbd3171ed62cc14372ead76755","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDA3YTkzNTMwM2I2ZjcyYmJkMzE3MWVkNjJjYzE0MzcyZWFkNzY3NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f","sha":"37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f"}],"sha":"07a935303b6f72bbd3171ed62cc14372ead76755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/07a935303b6f72bbd3171ed62cc14372ead76755"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:33:32Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:33:32Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"fix(drawer, upload): Escape respeta los overlays internos; el caller elige el correlationId\n\nDos cosas, las dos encontradas construyendo el flujo de publicación.\n\n**Escape cerraba el drawer entero** con un calendario abierto adentro,\nllevándose puesto lo que el usuario venía cargando. Los dos escuchan\n`document:keydown.escape` y ambos handlers corren; `stopPropagation` no sirve\n—son listeners sobre el mismo nodo— y `stopImmediatePropagation` dependería del\norden de registro, que acá es el contrario al que haría falta porque el drawer\nse crea antes que su contenido. El drawer ahora cede la tecla si hay un overlay\ninterno abierto.\n\n**El correlationId nacía y moría en el interceptor.** Para una operación\nasíncrona —subir un PDF y esperar a que el pipeline cree la factura— ese id ES\nel vínculo entre lo que se mandó y lo que vuelve: viaja por BFF, orquestador,\nworker y termina en `factura.correlation_id`. Pero el frontend lo generaba al\nvuelo y nunca sabía cuál había mandado. Ahora el interceptor respeta el que ya\nvenga puesto, y `uploadFileUsingPresignedUrl` lo devuelve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"6c2285a76fe22cd99c5651317eb1bc8617d5a9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/6c2285a76fe22cd99c5651317eb1bc8617d5a9de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDM3Y2QzNzNhZmViNjUwNjg3ZGU5Njg5ZDhkMGMyOWQ2MzQ0YzkxNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/c252b586d8fc06695e8749d9f92848a34913c0ed","sha":"c252b586d8fc06695e8749d9f92848a34913c0ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/c252b586d8fc06695e8749d9f92848a34913c0ed"}],"sha":"37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/37cd373afeb650687de9689d8d0c29d6344c916f"},{"author":{"avatar_u