users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/106e790b0d818c983b51990216d617a305e77a96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:53:54Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:53:54Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"feat(stepper): indicador de pasos en la librería\n\nEl wizard modal de publicación tenía el suyo en SCSS local. Al necesitar uno\npara el drawer, duplicarlo habría sido exactamente el patrón que la auditoría\ndel design system viene sacando, así que el nuevo nace compartido: cuando el\nmodal se retire, su copia local se va con él y queda uno solo.\n\nPresentacional: recibe en qué paso está y avisa cuándo alguien pide ir a otro.\nQuién decide si ese salto se permite es el componente que lo usa — hacia atrás\nsiempre deja, porque volver a revisar lo ya hecho no debería pedir permiso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"017808081c6eba498460abe2b9e7e87bc1df9171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/017808081c6eba498460abe2b9e7e87bc1df9171"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/106e790b0d818c983b51990216d617a305e77a96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht