raSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/830f92905d2590ab493055204b355fa8a1fe3c07","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDgzMGY5MjkwNWQyNTkwYWI0OTMwNTUyMDRiMzU1ZmE4YTFmZTNjMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf","sha":"5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf"}],"sha":"830f92905d2590ab493055204b355fa8a1fe3c07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/830f92905d2590ab493055204b355fa8a1fe3c07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:25:00Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:25:00Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"refactor(drawer): el host del drawer sube a shared-utils\n\nDrawerService es un singleton de shared-utils que cualquier MFE puede llamar,\npero solo setea una señal: quien renderiza es AppDrawerComponent, que vivía en\nseis-portal. Fuera del shell, open() no mostraba nada y fallaba en silencio.\n\nEl componente no tenía ninguna dependencia del portal —solo DrawerService e\nIconComponent, ambos de la librería— así que el movimiento es limpio. De paso,\ntemplate y estilos pasan a archivos propios, como el resto de la librería: en\nshared-utils los compila ng-packagr y el SCSS inline no está garantizado.\n\nEl portal lo importa desde shared-utils y el publicador monta el suyo, así que\nsigue andando standalone. Verificado en los dos contextos: abre con el ancho\nconfigurado, con los tokens del tema y Escape cierra.\n\nAparte: test_datepicker usaba un índice fijo de día. El campo tiene maxDate=hoy,\nasí que el día 1 de cada mes hay UN solo día elegible y el test pasaba o fallaba\nsegún la fecha en que se corriera. Ahora toma el último habilitado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"c0a1b22904613b7cbeb40499c0320ddd9f84e2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/c0a1b22904613b7cbeb40499c0320ddd9f84e2fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDViNzVkYjMyMDUzNjJlNzdjMzc1MGYyZTgxMjRkY2ZhZjUyMDNiYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd","sha":"89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd"}],"sha":"5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/5b75db3205362e77c3750f2e8124dcfaf5203bbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:55:02Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:55:02Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"sebastian"},"message":"fix(searchable-card-select): el velo de mobile no se podía tocar para cerrar\n\nEra `.sc-open::before`, y un pseudo-elemento no recibe listeners: el tap tenía\ncomo target al propio `.sc-select`, que está DENTRO del host, así que el\n@HostListener(''document:click'') lo daba por \"adentro\" y el panel no cerraba\nnunca. El velo tapaba la pantalla entera y no se podía descartar.\n\nPasa a ser un elemento real con su propio (click), que hace preventDefault()\npor lo mismo que el Datepicker: dentro de un <label>, la activación reabriría\nel panel en el mismo gesto.\n\nVerificado en navegador con sesión real, a 390px: el punto del velo ahora\ndevuelve div.sc-backdrop, el ::before ya no existe y tocarlo cierra. En desktop\nnada cambia.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0123aVc9VdULsB5EoEhPC3GJ","tree":{"sha":"d006c5fc5193e47d5455a21519739461b6fdd973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/d006c5fc5193e47d5455a21519739461b6fdd973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commit/89a7535a92a837d78c5d0e6b2021145901313ffd","node_id":"C_kwDORJdtadoAKDg5YTc1MzVhOTJhODM3ZDc4YzVkMGU2YjIwMjExNDU5MDEzMTNmZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91/seis-app-f