ithub.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/commits/2c631584e558826b6047da9633c1e70f30fedbc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:55:56Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:56:35Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian"},"message":"feat(shared-utils): reorganizar a atomic design y agregar 14 átomos nuevos\n\nFase 2 del refactor de design system: componentes reorganizados de\nlib/components/ (plano) a lib/{atoms,molecules,organisms}/, y el catálogo\nde componentes atómicos, dependency-free (sin Angular Material ni otras\nlibrerías de UI de terceros), construido íntegramente esta sesión:\n\nAtoms: Button, IconButton (+ tamaño lg), Input (+ type password, autocomplete,\nslot [input-suffix]), Label, Avatar, Icon (+ icon-registry, ~100 íconos SVG\ninline — reemplaza <mat-icon>/fuente de Material Icons sin traer la\ndependencia), Loader, Checkbox, SlideToggle, Badge, Chip, Skeleton, Select.\n\nMolecules: Card (con skeleton vía el átomo Skeleton, no una implementación\npropia), Modal, FormField (+ directiva FormFieldErrorDirective para el slot\nde mensajes de error), Datepicker (calendario propio con vista mensual,\npopup en desktop / bottom-sheet en mobile vía ViewportService — reemplaza\nAtomicDatepickerComponent/NgbInputDatepicker).\n\nDirectives: TooltipDirective (reemplaza matTooltip sin overlay/CDK).\n\nCada átomo documenta en su JSDoc qué patrón/duplicación concreta del\nworkspace reemplaza. Historias de Storybook para todos, verificadas\nvisualmente vía Playwright durante el desarrollo.\n\n_tokens.scss: agregado CA-10 (--space-*), CA-11 (--radius-*), CA-12\n(--shadow-*). public-api.ts: barrel actualizado con cada export nuevo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b79b7aa0466affa998228f5a49ad2bab4c6ed1a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/b79b7aa0466affa998228f5a49ad2bab4c6ed1a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/2c631584e558826b6047da9633c1e70f30fedbc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip