406/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:55:37Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:56:35Z","email":"parra.sebastian91@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian"},"message":"build: instalar y configurar Storybook para el workspace\n\nAgrega @storybook/angular + storybook (10.6.0), targets `storybook`/\n`build-storybook` en el proyecto seis-portal (puerto 6007, webpack5 clásico,\nno la integración Vite-nativa), y proxyConfig en `ng serve` para que las\nllamadas a /api caigan en el gateway local sin CORS.\n\nnpm run storybook / build-storybook reconstruyen shared-utils primero —\nStorybook usa el paquete compilado (dist/), no lee directo del código fuente\ndel submódulo, así que un build viejo deja los átomos nuevos con\n\"Cannot find module ''shared-utils''\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b81aa73338474b81c9402961f6a0dc069763041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/3b81aa73338474b81c9402961f6a0dc069763041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/3dc62ad9e1b640a4b266c0bdb313156a77f27406","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18011782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/parraSebastian91","id":18011782,"login":"parraSebastian91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDExNzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parraSebastian91/re