Factor) (CA-05)\n  • Tokens de estado --color-success/warning/error/info (CA-04)\n  • Variables de fuentes --font-sans / --font-mono (CA-07)\n  • Variables de escala tipográfica + clases .text-{rol} (CA-08)\n  • Excepción documentada CA-09 (.pre-liquidacion-card usa --ref-navy-deep)\n- theme.interface.ts: OrgBrandTokens, DataThemeMode (CA-05, CA-06)\n- theme.service.ts:\n  • setDataTheme(mode) — setAttribute(''data-theme'', mode) en <html>\n  • initTheme() — dark fijo MVP + loadTheme()\n  • applyOrgTokens(tokens) — inyección runtime --org-brand-* (CA-05)\n  • resetOrgTokens() — restaura defaults Factor\n  • validateContrast(bg, fg): boolean — WCAG AA ratio >= 4.5:1 (CA-05/EB-01)\n  • loadTheme: try/catch en JSON.parse; reset: usa globalThis.getComputedStyle\n- seis-portal submodule actualizado (commit b2c9270)","tree":{"sha":"632f262696fa1cc9013a03b8db005e52f56911db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/trees/632f262696fa1cc9013a03b8db005e52f56911db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parraSebastian91/seis-app-frontend/git/commits/e286f98b09177b6188a1a5bcefffb0f1e57d943b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236401249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sparraimed","id":236401249,"login":"sparraimed","node_id":"U_kgDODhcyYQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sparraimed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s