"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/aeac934583765dfc8c26a8e328b5966e9b72b49e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"ci: add PR build, Sonar analysis and chachalog workflows\n\nThe repository had no workflows at all, so nothing built, linted or gated a change\non its way to main. Adds the standard Jahia module PR gate - static analysis, Maven\nbuild and SonarQube analysis - plus the two globally managed chachalog workflows, so\nthe .chachalog fragments this repo now carries are actually consumed.\n\nDeliberately omits the update-signature job the reference workflow carries; the\nmaintainers should add it if this module is meant to ship signed.","tree":{"sha":"8bb1ca222b6be59a4ceeb191af1770ab14b4ef2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/trees/8bb1ca222b6be59a4ceeb191af1770ab14b4ef2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/commits/aeac934583765dfc8c26a8e328b5966e9b72b49e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/aeac934583765dfc8c26a8e328b5966e9b72b49e","node_id":"C_kwDORJexy9oAKGFlYWM5MzQ1ODM3NjVkZmM4YzI2YThlMzI4YjU5NjZlOWI3MmI0OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb","sha":"d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb"}],"sha":"aeac934583765dfc8c26a8e328b5966e9b72b49e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/aeac934583765dfc8c26a8e328b5966e9b72b49e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"build: pin yarn 1 so the project installs again\n\nA .yarnrc.yml had been committed alongside a yarn v1 lockfile, which makes a\ncorepack-managed yarn treat this as a Berry project and refuse to install:\n\"This package doesn''t seem to be present in your lockfile\". The pom already pins\nyarn 1.22 for the Maven build, so only direct yarn use was affected - including the\nlint step of CI.\n\nPins packageManager to yarn@1.22.22 and drops the Berry artifacts that were\ncommitted with it, install-state.gz caches included.","tree":{"sha":"5b78fa0b39386925efebd6c00503f81d70ff38cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/trees/5b78fa0b39386925efebd6c00503f81d70ff38cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/commits/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb","node_id":"C_kwDORJexy9oAKGQ4MDQxMDg1ZmY4ODU4OThkYTc3YjQ1NjJhODM3YjcxODJkODRlZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c","sha":"f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c"}],"sha":"d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/d8041085ff885898da77b4562a837b7182d84edb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:50Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"docs: correct archive documentation and describe partial outcomes\n\nThe docs had drifted from the code: the archive folder was documented as ''archive''\nwhen it is ''Archives'', paths were written /<siteKey>/ instead of /sites/<siteKey>/,\nunarchiving was described as \"if implemented\" when it ships, and GET_NODE_INFO was\ncredited with returning publication status it never requested - the belief behind\nthe guard this branch fixes.\n\nAlso documents what was already true but unwritten: the JCR lock is what makes\narchived content read-only, not the ACLs the README told integrators to configure.","tree":{"sha":"3ddf8cc5aee71871eb8a9f84fc6ef66181ca0e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/trees/3ddf8cc5aee71871eb8a9f84fc6ef66181ca0e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/commits/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c","node_id":"C_kwDORJexy9oAKGYyZjkzMTIxNDA3ZTJlOTA3ODBmYWFiYmJiN2EwN2VjYzMwMzQ3M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/archive/commit/34916a9a56441cab706305ea363cbfb157f38e5c","sha":"34916a9a56441cab706305ea363cbfb157f38e5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/34916a9a56441cab706305ea363cbfb157f38e5c"}],"sha":"f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/f2f93121407e2e90780faabbbb7a07ecc303473c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/commits/34916a9a56441cab706305ea363cbfb157f38e5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:34Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:22:34Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"fix: block archiving of published content and recover from partial failures\n\nThe publication guard inside archiveNode() read aggregatedPublicationInfo and\nisPublished, neither of which GET_NODE_INFO requests, so it always concluded the\ncontent was unpublished. The only effective check was the one in the confirmation\ndialog, which any other caller of ArchiveService.archiveNode() bypassed. Both paths\nnow share getPublishedLanguages(), which queries every site language.\n\nThat shared check also stops failing open: a failed site-languages lookup silently\nnarrowed it to English, and a failed per-language lookup was recorded as \"not\npublished\". Both now reject, because an unreadable status is not evidence that\ncontent is unpublished.\n\nArchiving applied the jmix:archived mixin and its mandatory properties in two\nrequests, so a failure in between left content flagged as archived in its original\nlocation, where neither the Archive action (hidden on jmix:archived) nor the Restore\naction (needs originalParentId) could recover it. They are now one mutation, and the\nsteps that must stay separate compensate: a failed move removes the marker, and a\nrestore that fails after unlocking re-locks the content. The two states that can\nsurvive a failure - archived but unlocked, restored but still marked - are returned\nas flags and surfaced as warnings instead of being reported as plain success.","tree":{"sha":"c5da4aedeab21b5ccbf3204679e89dc46a66cd33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/trees/c5da4aedeab21b5ccbf3204679e89dc46a66cd33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/commits/34916a9a56441cab706305ea363cbfb157f38e5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":