0.x boolean checksResult\n\nThe recent guard `!checksResult?.displayAction` assumed the object-\nshape `checksResult` returned by `@jahia/data-helper@1.1.x`. This\nmodule is pinned to `@jahia/data-helper@~1.0.12` (see 1.1.0 release\nnotes), where `useNodeChecks` returns `checksResult` as a plain\nboolean. On a boolean, `?.displayAction` is undefined, so the guard\nalways fired and the Restore action never rendered in the Content\nActions menu for `jmix:archived` nodes.\n\nSwitch to a direct truthy check on `checksResult`, matching the\nsibling `ArchiveContentAction`''s existing guard shape. When the\ndata-helper pin is eventually lifted to 1.1.x, both actions should\nbe updated together to the `displayAction` object shape.","tree":{"sha":"b75223af9ef2f9f41f2fbfc2b1851a573e25a3df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/trees/b75223af9ef2f9f41f2fbfc2b1851a573e25a3df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/archive/git/commits/8527582886b8fcbb9401000e6789a7baae3ffd10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sm