 call to\n  clockworks/tiktok-scraper (configurable via APIFY_TIKTOK_ACTOR),\n  maps top videos by playCount into the shared trend shape\n- Cascade is now SerpAPI -> YouTube -> Apify -> Gemini -> empty;\n  no-source error message lists all four keys\n- APIFY_API_TOKEN / APIFY_TIKTOK_ACTOR added to backend/.env.example\n- test_trends_sniper.py: 11 tests covering actor contract, mapping,\n  sorting/capping, cascade placement, fall-through, and TTL cache","tree":{"sha":"510cea6d970484aae6eb38c0be0a706237acc110","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/trees/510cea6d970484aae6eb38c0be0a706237acc110"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/commits/5ae9dae5fa56a67479110fde9c2bdcafbe1e1505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157228826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tusharui","id":157228826,"login":"tusharui","node_id":"U_kgDOCV8fGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commit/5ae9dae5fa56a67479110fde9c2bdcafbe1e1505","node_id":"C_kwDORJgi_doAKDVhZTlkYWU1ZmE1NmE2NzQ3OTExMGZkZTljMmJkY2FmYmUxZTE1MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commit/3f9dbb5d6c28f64b3f81c391f254c0060123cfbc","sha":"3f9dbb5d6c28f64b3f81c391f254c0060123cfbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commits/3f9dbb5d6c28f64b3f81c391f254c0060123cfbc"}],"sha":"5ae9dae5fa56a67479110fde9c2bdcafbe1e1505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commits/5ae9dae5fa56a67479110fde9c2bdcafbe1e1505"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157228826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tusharui","id":157228826,"login":"tusharui","node_id":"U_kgDOCV8fGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commits/eb566a47bf97c3aff60f82f3f272b16fa91f8c93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:22:55Z","email":"tusharanshu18@gmail.com","name":"Tushar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:22:55Z","email":"tusharanshu18@gmail.com","name":"Tushar"},"message":"feat(alpha-brief): idempotent EventBridge cron provisioning + runbook\n\nThe generator, Redis caching, and Lambda handler are already merged\n(PR #11) but nothing wires the schedule into AWS — the daily brief only\nregenerated when someone hit the API.\n\n- scripts/setup-alpha-brief-cron.sh: one-time, re-runnable AWS CLI\n  bootstrap — builds the package (same recipe as CI), creates/updates\n  the avoir-alpha-brief-cron Lambda, IAM role, EventBridge rule\n  cron(15 0 * * ? *), invoke permission, and 14d log retention.\n  --dry-run / --invoke flags; env vars copied from shell, never hardcoded.\n- docs/ALPHA_BRIEF_CRON.md: founder runbook — architecture, setup,\n  verification, degradation behavior, troubleshooting.","tree":{"sha":"171b04b0a809de55d5a0774060dc7f51138949f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/trees/171b04b0a809de55d5a0774060dc7f51138949f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/commits/eb566a47bf97c3aff60f82f3f272b16fa91f8c93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157228826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tusharui","id":157228826,"login":"tusharui","node_id":"U_kgDOCV8fGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commit/eb566a47bf97c3aff60f82f3f272b16fa91f8c93","node_id":"C_kwDORJgi_doAKGViNTY2YTQ3YmY5N2MzYWZmNjBmODJmM2YyNzJiMTZmYTkxZjhjOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commit/3f9dbb5d6c28f64b3f81c391f254c0060123cfbc","sha":"3f9dbb5d6c28f64b3f81c391