:"2026-08-20T14:07:31Z","email":"tusharanshu18@gmail.com","name":"Tushar"},"message":"refactor: extract CampaignDashboard into composable sub-components\n\nBreak the 2196-line CampaignDashboard monolith into focused components:\n- CampaignSidebar: navigation + campaign library\n- CampaignChat: message thread + simulation UI\n- CampaignCanvas: strategy cards + funnel + captions\n- CampaignInputBar: directive input + genome toggle\n- CookingStatus, MagneticButton, WelcomeScreen: shared UI primitives\n- types.ts, configs.ts, utils.ts: shared exports\n\nParent orchestrator pattern: all state lives in CampaignDashboard,\nsub-components receive props. Zero behavioral changes, zero type errors.","tree":{"sha":"5d080e48fc233964dcb718417db96a0029327207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/trees/5d080e48fc233964dcb718417db96a0029327207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/commits/b8f400b4d93b7c29e9a8933bb319382f906dea48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157228826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tusharui","id":157228826,"login":"tusharui","node_id":"U_kgDOCV8fGg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui","user_view_type