s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/commits/c3359b4a0ff8edeeb4b33ecfa46ba48cd4a673df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:50:36Z","email":"tusharanshu18@gmail.com","name":"Tushar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:50:36Z","email":"tusharanshu18@gmail.com","name":"Tushar"},"message":"fix: serverless timeout, credit refunds, ghost polling, base64 payload guard\n\n- Add maxDuration = 300 to allow 5 minutes for HeyGen polling\n- Refund 50 credits if pipeline fails before HeyGen accepts the task\n  (ElevenLabs error, oversized audio, client disconnect, etc.)\n- Pass AbortSignal from request through pipeline → pollVideo to cleanly\n  abort polling when client disconnects (prevents ghost polling memory leak)\n- Add base64 payload size guard (1MB limit) to prevent HeyGen 413 errors\n  on long scripts","tree":{"sha":"d3a5b69a60b008da312083b62b718a9a20970eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/trees/d3a5b69a60b008da312083b62b718a9a20970eaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SxBxcoder/Avoir/git/commits/c3359b4a0ff8edeeb4b33ecfa46ba48cd4a673df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157228826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tusharui/gists{/gist_id}",