ingState entity and IOnboardingStateRepository interface for state management.\n- Implement OnboardingLocalStorageAdapter for persistent storage in localStorage (web) and AsyncStorage (mobile).\n- Develop GuidedOnboardingFlow component for user interaction during onboarding.\n- Establish OnboardingContext for managing onboarding state and actions.\n- Create tests for onboarding use cases and local storage adapter to ensure functionality.\n- Introduce orchestration logic to manage onboarding and brain-today check-in flow.\n- Document onboarding QA checklist and design decisions for future reference.","tree":{"sha":"b511cee65b03ba2195857ebe098afe7bca27a458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/trees/b511cee65b03ba2195857ebe098afe7bca27a458"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/commits/f9ca1b285e04461dad45d1ec01072f24d10d1e5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeticiaRosa","id":37852713,"login":"LeticiaRosa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODUyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.