2026-03-10T00:14:09Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"message":"feat: update UI text to Portuguese and improve accessibility\n\n- Changed button labels and aria-labels from \"Add step\" and \"Add step\" to \"Adicionar step\" in AddStepDialog and AddStepForm components.\n- Updated AppearanceMenuPanel component to reflect Portuguese translations for appearance settings.\n- Removed unused Dialog component to streamline code.\n- Translated FocusTimer and FocusTimerFocus components to Portuguese, including timer labels and tooltips.\n- Updated SmartChecklist component to use Portuguese for task-related messages and tooltips.\n- Translated TaskCard and TaskEditForm components to Portuguese, including task management messages.\n- Updated TimerPreferencesPanel component to reflect Portuguese translations for timer settings.\n- Enhanced UserMenuDropdown component with Portuguese translations for user settings and actions.\n- Updated hooks to provide Portuguese error and success messages for task operations.\n- Added CI workflow for linting, type-checking, building, and testing.\n- Improved Sonner toast notifications with custom styles and translations.","tree":{"sha":"d7d67c0ea7ac5596f1bd351c409d5def41a5b6a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/trees/d7d67c0ea7ac5596f1bd351c409d5def41a5b6a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/commits/93cb63c8e924fd95929ba3e4a18da06eb91ce1ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git