ira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T00:08:39Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"message":"feat: enhance brain state management and UI components\n\n- Introduced BrainStateColorToken for better color management in BrainState.\n- Updated BrainStateOptions to use color tokens instead of hex values.\n- Refactored BrainTodayBottomSheet to resolve colors using the new color tokens.\n- Adjusted DashboardHeader layout and added a subtitle for better user guidance.\n- Simplified FocusTimer component by removing unused isActive state.\n- Updated RoutineIcon to utilize theme colors for better consistency.\n- Enhanced SmartChecklist with improved styling and layout adjustments.\n- Refactored TaskCard to streamline task management and improve UI interactions.\n- Updated TaskGroup to handle task deletion, archiving, and updates more effectively.\n- Improved UserMenuBottomSheet styling for better visual consistency.\n- Refined UserMenuDropdown by removing unused properties and improving code clarity.\n- Updated theme colors for better accessibility and visual coherence across light and dark modes.","tree":{"sha":"be995940ef37166cabea6a14a503dba1352ff618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/trees/be995940ef37166cabea6a14a503dba1352ff618"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/commits/c7741596a69558a68aad2a569854c7e25488e45f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/