":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/commits/50fca11d5adb2820cdb8c12ba569693f00c50b61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T22:47:10Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T22:47:10Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"message":"Add React Native best practices for native memory management, platform differences, profiling, SDK usage, threading model, turbo modules, view flattening, and related skills\n\n- Create documentation for native memory management patterns across C++, Swift, and Kotlin.\n- Add platform differences for iOS and Android tooling, dependency management, and build systems.\n- Introduce profiling techniques for native code using Xcode Instruments and Android Studio Profiler.\n- Document the advantages of using native SDKs over web polyfills for performance improvements.\n- Explain the threading model for Turbo Modules and Fabric in React Native.\n- Provide guidelines for building fast native modules with Turbo Modules.\n- Detail view flattening optimization and how to prevent unexpected child flattening in native components.\n- Update skills-lock.json to include new skills.","tree":{"sha":"5f2d2ffbe23a47a95ab873e5a9cd56591094938d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/trees/5f2d2ffbe23a47a95ab873e5a9cd56591094938d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/MindEase/git/commits/50fca11d5adb2820cdb8c12ba569693f00c50b61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Letic